#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This &systemsettings; module allows you to configure which files should be "
"indexed for fast searching. It internally uses a technology called Baloo to "
"efficiently search through the files."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid "Exclude Folders"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You are presented with a list of folders which should not be searched. By "
"default your entire $HOME directory is indexed, and no other drives are "
"indexed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Removable media is never indexed by default. It can be explicitly removed from "
"the list of exclude folders and it will then be indexed."
msgstr ""
